---
title: "generate_u64_in_range (Sui Framework: random)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_range: assert min <= max
    q_check_range --> q_abort: min > max
    q_abort --> [*]: abort EInvalidRange
    q_check_range --> q_check_equal: min <= max
    q_check_equal --> q_return_min: min == max
    q_return_min --> [*]: return min
    q_check_equal --> q_calc: min != max
    q_calc --> q_gen_bytes: range_size = (max - min) + 1
    q_gen_bytes --> q_modulo: rand = uint_from_bytes(g, 16 bytes)
    q_modulo --> [*]: return min + (rand % range_size)

    note right of q_gen_bytes
        INV-001: uses 16 bytes (128 bits) for 64-bit range to limit bias to 2^-64
        INV-002: modulo bias exists but is negligible (2^-64)
        INV-003: result guaranteed in [min, max] inclusive
    end note
